// =============================================================================
// Coppin the Trader — Market / Commerce.  Questline: "The Glimmer Road" (vendor.market)
// Keystone: the Trade Charter.  Teaches the Glimmer faucet, trade routes, rumor board.
// Reacts to Sable's choice ($sableChoiceReported) for a small authored payoff.
// =============================================================================
title: TalkToMarket
---
<<if $q_market_stage == 0>>
    Coppin: Buy, sell, survive — that's the whole song, friend. Trouble is, the roads aren't safe to sing it on.
    -> Let me clear a road for you.
        Coppin: Clear the road to the next outpost and I'll cut you in on the Glimmer that flows down it.
        <<set $q_market_stage = 1>>
        <<StartQuest vendor.market>>
        Coppin: "The Glimmer Road." Keep the wagons breathing and we both get rich.
    -> Just trade.
        <<OpenShop "market">>
<<elseif $q_market_stage == 1>>
    Coppin: Is the road to the outpost clear?
    -> The road's open.
        <<AdvanceQuest vendor.market>>
        <<set $q_market_stage = 2>>
        Coppin: Caravans rolling again! Now let's make it a proper route — keep it protected and the Glimmer starts to trickle. Honest coin, mind. Never pay-to-win in MY market.
    -> Not yet.
        Coppin: Bandits don't haggle, friend. Clear 'em.
<<elseif $q_market_stage == 2>>
    Coppin: Is the trade route steady?
    -> The Glimmer's flowing.
        <<AdvanceQuest vendor.market>>
        <<set $q_market_stage = 3>>
        Coppin: Then let's expand the network — every outpost we link feeds Brom's rumor board. That board's how you'll hear what every other soul in Elarion needs done.
    -> Not yet.
        Coppin: A route's no good if it dries up. Guard it.
<<elseif $q_market_stage == 3>>
    Coppin: Is the network expanded to the rumor board?
    -> The board's live.
        <<AdvanceQuest vendor.market>>
        <<GiveKeystone "TradeCharter">>
        <<set $q_market_stage = 9>>
        Coppin: Then the Trade Charter's yours, and Elarion's roads are mine to run. Discounts at my stall, friend.
        <<if $sableChoiceReported>>
            Coppin: And — that broker Sable warned me of? Paying in dirty Glimmer. I've barred him from every route. You did right.
        <<endif>>
    -> Not yet.
        Coppin: Link the outposts. The board pays for itself.
<<else>>
    Coppin: The Charter-holder! Best prices in Elarion for you. What're we trading?
    -> Browse the market.
        <<OpenShop "market">>
    -> Upgrade the market.
        <<OpenUpgrade "market">>
    -> Nothing today.
        Coppin: Roads are open. Spend freely.
<<endif>>
===
